    given-names: "José"
    affiliation: "University of Murcia"

version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-04"

abstract: >
  Open scientific software for organizing, processing and analysing
  longitudinal heart rate variability (HRV) data obtained from repeated
  measurements. The software automatically imports Kubios HRV reports,
  anonymizes participants, organizes repeated measurements and generates
  standardized scientific outputs for reproducible research.

license: "MIT"

